# path: /v1/chat/completions
# base-url: https://api.meta.ai   (export META_BASE_URL=https://api.meta.ai ; the path above carries /v1)
# content-type: json
# model: muse-spark-1.3-contributor   (user decision 2026-10-28: contributor tier, training on our prompts is acceptable, cheaper)
# verified: https://dev.meta.ai/docs/image-understanding + https://dev.meta.ai/docs/features/chat-completion (2026-10-28):
#   OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions; images go in content parts {"type":"image_url","image_url":{"url": data URL}},
#   several images per message are allowed. max_completion_tokens (max_tokens still accepted as deprecated alias).
#   Muse Spark is a reasoning model: temperature default 1.0 is recommended, "stop"/logprobs/n>1 -> 400,
#   reasoning_effort in none|minimal|low|medium|high|xhigh ("none" -> 400 on Muse Spark). Reply:
#   choices[0].message.content. Standard tier $1.25/M in, $4.25/M out; muse-spark-1.3-contributor is the cheap tier.
# changed 2026-10-28: max_completion_tokens counts reasoning tokens (the 600-token sheet probe came back "length"
#   with content null), so 16 cannot survive reasoning -> 64 (mirrors core/meta Prompts).
# probed: 16 and 64 run out of budget on reasoning (finish_reason "length", content null) -> 512.
# changed 2026-10-28 (T10, live run 1): 512 ran out too with 9 images (toy-car-02) -> 1024. Output tokens are billed
#   as used; the cap only stops truncation (mirrors core/meta Prompts.SCORE_MAX_COMPLETION_TOKENS).
# added 2026-10-28 (T11, user decision): an attempt below 0.7 is scored again with Prompts.STYLE_SCORE_NO_COLOUR
#   (technique only, the character's colours ignored) in the same request shape; swap the text part to probe it.
{
  "model": "muse-spark-1.3-contributor",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        { "type": "text", "text": "You are a strict art director. Rate from 0.00 to 1.00 how closely the FIRST image matches the drawing style (line weight, palette, shading) of the reference images that follow. Reply with the number only." },
        { "type": "image_url", "image_url": { "url": "data:{{INPUT_MIME}};base64,{{INPUT_B64}}" } }{{REF_CHAT_PARTS}}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reasoning_effort": "low",
  "max_completion_tokens": 1024
}
